---
// The queue as Redis lists. No numbers: names and commands only, all of them
// in p08_jobs.py / p08_worker.py.
const W = 900, H = 330;
---
<figure class="bep8q">
  <div class="bep8q-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Left to right: the API pushes a job onto the jobs list with LPUSH and answers 202. A separate worker process moves it with BLMOVE to the processing list, runs it, and only then removes it with LREM, the ack. A job that sits in the processing list is claimed, not lost; it is outlined in red.">
    <rect x="10" y="90" width="130" height="90" rx="10" class="box" />
    <image href="/icons/flow/fastapi.svg" x="35" y="106" width="80" height="14.8" aria-hidden="true" />
    <text x="75" y="146" text-anchor="middle" class="h">API</text>
    <text x="75" y="166" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>answers 202</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trả 202</tspan></text>

    <line x1="140" y1="135" x2="218" y2="135" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="230,135 218,129 218,141" class="hd" />
    <text x="185" y="122" text-anchor="middle" class="code">LPUSH</text>

    <rect x="230" y="90" width="150" height="90" rx="10" class="box" />
    <image href="/icons/flow/mailbox.svg" x="244" y="102" width="24" height="21" aria-hidden="true" />
    <text x="278" y="118" class="h">Redis</text>
    <text x="305" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="code">jobs:reports</text>
    <text x="305" y="168" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>waiting</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đang chờ</tspan></text>

    <line x1="380" y1="135" x2="458" y2="135" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="470,135 458,129 458,141" class="hd" />
    <text x="425" y="122" text-anchor="middle" class="code">BLMOVE</text>

    <rect x="470" y="90" width="190" height="90" rx="10" class="box redbox" />
    <text x="565" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="code">jobs:reports:processing</text>
    <text x="565" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>claimed, not finished</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đã nhận, chưa xong</tspan></text>
    <text x="565" y="168" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>still stored in Redis</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vẫn nằm trong Redis</tspan></text>

    <line x1="660" y1="135" x2="718" y2="135" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="730,135 718,129 718,141" class="hd" />

    <rect x="730" y="90" width="160" height="90" rx="10" class="box" />
    <image href="/icons/flow/python.svg" x="745" y="104" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true" />
    <text x="777" y="120" class="h">worker</text>
    <text x="810" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>another process</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>process riêng</tspan></text>
    <text x="810" y="168" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>runs the job</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy job</tspan></text>

    <polyline points="810,180 810,236 565,236 565,192" class="ln" fill="none" />
    <polygon points="565,180 559,192 571,192" class="hd" />
    <text x="690" y="226" text-anchor="middle" class="code">LREM</text>
    <text x="690" y="262" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>ack: delete from processing, only after success</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ack: xoá khỏi processing, chỉ sau khi thành công</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="304" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>if the worker dies before the ack, the job is still in the processing list</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nếu worker chết trước khi ack, job vẫn còn trong list processing</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A job is moved, not popped. The move is what makes a crash survivable: at every moment the job is in at least one list.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Job được chuyển đi chứ không bị lấy ra. Chính việc chuyển đó giúp sống sót qua một lần crash: lúc nào job cũng nằm trong ít nhất một list.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep8q { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep8q-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep8q svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep8q text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep8q .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15.5px; }
  .bep8q .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep8q .b { fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep8q .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep8q .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep8q .box.redbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep8q .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep8q .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep8q figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
